1
00:00:00,473 --> 00:00:03,543
(Raj:)because there's a bumblebee
in my office.

2
00:00:04,443 --> 00:00:06,673
(Leonard:)I saw it. It's big.

3
00:00:07,647 --> 00:00:09,447
(Howard:)Anyway,
like I said in the e-mail,

4
00:00:09,448 --> 00:00:10,878
(Howard:)this meeting's on Thursday.

5
00:00:10,883 --> 00:00:12,813
(Howard:)Do you have any advice for us?

6
00:00:12,818 --> 00:00:14,718
(Marty:)Well, I don't know much
about patent law.

7
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,420
But, uh, my advice is:

8
00:00:16,422 --> 00:00:19,052
(Marty:)hear them out, offer as little
information as possible,

9
00:00:19,058 --> 00:00:21,458
(Marty:)and whatever you do,
don't sign anything.

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:24,090
"Don't sign anything"?
That's your advice?

11
00:00:24,096 --> 00:00:26,326
(Sheldon:)Okay, so, uh, if
during this meeting,

12
00:00:26,332 --> 00:00:29,402
(Sheldon:)one of us were to, say,
complete an oil painting,

13
00:00:29,402 --> 00:00:33,172
(Sheldon:)you'd recommend that
we leave that unsigned?

14
00:00:33,172 --> 00:00:34,542
(Marty:)That's not what I meant.

15
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,610
(Sheldon:)That's what you said.

16
00:00:35,608 --> 00:00:36,378
(Marty:)That's not what I meant.

17
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,445
(Sheldon:)This must be how
you practice law

18
00:00:38,444 --> 00:00:40,674
(Sheldon:)in Boca Raton, by saying
things you don't mean

19
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,550
(Sheldon:)and meaning things
you don't say.

20
00:00:42,548 --> 00:00:45,278
(Marty:)Howard, why is he yelling at me?

21
00:00:45,284 --> 00:00:47,284
All right, you
were on Jeopardy.

22
00:00:47,286 --> 00:00:50,926
Allow me to Alex Trebek this and
put it in the form of a question:

23
00:00:50,923 --> 00:00:54,393
Who has been a complete
waste of our time?

24
00:00:55,695 --> 00:00:57,095
(Howard:)Marty, let me call you back.

25
00:00:57,096 --> 00:00:58,996
(Leonard:)Someday, when I'm up
on murder charges,

26
00:00:58,998 --> 00:01:01,898
(Leonard:)you'll be hearing from me.

